{
 "title": "Feature",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**`feature`** 是一份契约，规定了一个类型必须具备的能力和方法签名（在其他语言中叫“接口”或“trait”）。不写方法体；类型本身写作 `Self`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "Greengold **没有**类似 `impl Feature for Type` 的声明。如果一个类型定义了某个 feature 的所有方法，且名称、参数个数、模式和返回类型都相同，它就**自动**满足该 feature。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "feature Measurable:",
    "    fn area(self: Self) -> f64",
    "",
    "struct Circle:",
    "    radius: f64",
    "",
    "impl Circle:",
    "    fn area(self) -> f64:",
    "        return 3.0 * self.radius * self.radius",
    "",
    "struct Square:",
    "    side: f64",
    "",
    "impl Square:",
    "    fn area(self) -> f64:",
    "        return self.side * self.side",
    "",
    "fn print_area[T: Measurable](item: T):",
    "    print(\"area:\", item.area())",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print_area(Circle{ radius: 2.0 })",
    "    print_area(Square{ side: 5.0 })"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "area: 12",
    "area: 25"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "`[T: Measurable]` 是一个 **feature 约束**：只接受具备该能力的类型。多个约束用 `+` 书写：`[T: Measurable + Printable]`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c07-l03-x1",
   "prompt": "定义一个 `Named` feature（`fn name(self: Self) -> str`）。让结构体 `Dog` 和 `Cat` 各自写出方法 `name`（`Rex`、`Tom`）。`hello[T: Named](x: T)` 应该对两者都适用，并输出 `hello, <名字>`。",
   "starter": [
    "struct Dog:",
    "    id: i32",
    "",
    "struct Cat:",
    "    id: i32",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(\"?\")"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "feature Named:",
    "    fn name(self: Self) -> str",
    "",
    "struct Dog:",
    "    id: i32",
    "",
    "impl Dog:",
    "    fn name(self) -> str:",
    "        return \"Rex\"",
    "",
    "struct Cat:",
    "    id: i32",
    "",
    "impl Cat:",
    "    fn name(self) -> str:",
    "        return \"Tom\"",
    "",
    "fn hello[T: Named](x: T):",
    "    print(\"hello,\", x.name())",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    hello(Dog{ id: 1 })",
    "    hello(Cat{ id: 2 })"
   ],
   "hint": "写 `feature Named:`，给两个结构体都加上 `name` 方法，然后用 `[T: Named]` 定义 `hello`。",
   "expected": [
    "hello, Rex",
    "hello, Tom"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c07-l03-q1",
   "q": "类型如何满足一个 feature？",
   "options": [
    "通过写 `impl Feature for Type`",
    "通过用相同的签名定义所需的方法",
    "通过在文件开头写 `use`"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "结构化匹配：只要签名吻合，feature 就自动满足。"
  }
 ]
}
